# Meridian — Cloudflare response headers (F1: immutable caching)
# Deployed location: root of the static output (dist/client/_headers),
# copied there by the build from public/_headers. Honoured by Cloudflare
# Pages and Workers Static Assets, which serve the live site; GitHub Pages
# ignores this file (harmless).
#
# Scope: /assets/* — the Vite/Rolldown build output. MOST files there are
# content-hashed (a content change produces a new filename/URL), so a
# cached copy can never go stale and is safe to cache for a year as
# immutable. This matches the rule the Nitro/Vercel build already emits
# in .vercel/output/config.json for /assets/(.*).
#
# Carve-outs (Core F-1): NOT every file under /assets/* is content-hashed.
# Three files have stable names with mutable content and must never be
# immutable — each gets an exact-path rule after the wildcard below,
# setting Cache-Control back to the revalidate default (the exact path
# is the more specific match; rules are listed specific-after-general):
#   - /assets/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs and /assets/maplibre-gl-shared.mjs
#     are emitted verbatim from node_modules/maplibre-gl/dist by the
#     maplibre-worker-files plugin in vite.config.ts — a MapLibre
#     upgrade replaces them under the SAME filenames.
#   - /assets/storyteller/storyteller-assets.json is a build-generated
#     manifest fetched at runtime by storyteller-home.tsx — its content
#     changes whenever the storyteller asset set changes, same filename.
#
# Deliberately NOT immutable: everything else keeps Cloudflare's default
# (public, max-age=0, must-revalidate). /flags.json, /audio/*, /icons/*,
# /images/*, /loop/*, sw.js and HTML all have stable names with mutable
# content (e.g. narration mp3s were replaced under the same filenames in
# PR #174, and sw.js is re-fingerprinted every build), so they must keep
# revalidating — no rule below touches them.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/maplibre-gl-shared.mjs
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/assets/storyteller/storyteller-assets.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
